<title>UK: IOC tenders for 540,000 tonnes propane and butane.</title>
<headline>IOC tenders for 540,000 tonnes propane and butane.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian Oil Corporation (IOC) said it has tendered to buy 540,000 tonnes of Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG) in the year starting in July.</p>
<p>The tender calls for 18 cargoes, each of 25,000 tonnes of butane and 5,000 tonnes of propane, to be delivered at the rate of three every two months from July to June 1998.</p>
<p>The tender is open until May 27 and bids must be valid until May 30.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
